#: src/components/GuidedTour.svelte
msgid "Enter the asking price for your item as a whole number."
msgstr "商品の希望価格を整数で入力します。"

#: src/components/GuidedTour.svelte
msgid "Enter the asking price for this vehicle as a whole number."
msgstr "この車両の希望価格を整数で入力してください。"

#: src/components/GuidedTour.svelte
msgid "Enter the monthly rent for this room as a whole number."
